# Tater Talk Project Structure Guide

## Main Architecture
- Main entry point: [src/pages/index.astro](mdc:src/pages/index.astro) - Landing page combining all sections
- Base layout: [src/layouts/Layout.astro](mdc:src/layouts/Layout.astro) - Global HTML structure with fonts and meta tags
- Global styles: [src/styles/global.css](mdc:src/styles/global.css) - Design system, animations, and Tailwind imports

## Component Organization
```
src/components/
├── layout/          # Site-wide layout components
│   ├── Header.astro # Fixed navigation header
│   └── Footer.astro # Site footer with links
├── sections/        # Main page sections
│   ├── Hero.astro          # Hero section with CTA
│   ├── Features.astro      # Feature showcase grid
│   ├── Demo.astro          # Interactive demo mockup
│   └── CallToAction.astro  # Final conversion section
└── ui/              # Reusable UI components
    └── FeatureCard.astro   # Individual feature cards
```

## Design Philosophy
- **Audio-themed branding**: Microphone icons, sound waves, speech-focused copy
- **Dark theme**: Purple/cyan gradients with professional appearance
- **Typecraft.dev inspiration**: Similar aesthetic but tailored for speech-to-text
- **Accessibility focus**: High contrast, semantic HTML, screen reader friendly